{"baseline":{"timeout_pct":0,"avg_sec":175.37,"success_pct":0.995},"task":"[Автозадача из бэклога] [cc reliability ROOT FIX, field targeting] In layers/uia.py find_element (around lines 330-372): when the match (FindAll / relaxed find) returns MORE THAN ONE candidate Edit, do not blindly return tree-order [0]. Disambiguate in this priority: (1) prefer a candidate with CurrentHasKeyboardFocus==True; (2) else drop candidates with IsOffscreen==True; (3) else prefer the on-screen candidate by bounding-rectangle region (Telegram\u0027s message composer sits in the bottom region, the search box in the top bar); (4) only fall back to [0] when no focus/visibility signal distinguishes them. ROOT CAUSE: Telegram exposes duplicate \u0027Поиск(Edit)\u0027 and \u0027Сообщение...(Edit)\u0027 elements; order-blind elements[0] selection lets set_value target a phantom/hidden duplicate or the search Edit instead of the focused composer. Add a unit test feeding find_element (stubbed FindAll) two duplicate \u0027Сообщение...(Edit)\u0027 peers (one IsOffscreen/unfocused, one on-screen/focused) asserting the focused on-screen one is returned; second case two \u0027Поиск(Edit)\u0027, assert the visible top-bar one is chosen.","commit":"ba0b9484075fe855940df546d9e85a3b71c30ad0","type":"hypothesis","ts":"2026-06-16T05:17:27.2538497Z"}
