e.ps1.\r\n- Self-model smoke checks size cap, sections, compact summary, and no source writes.\r\n\r\n","after_turns":154,"after":{"timeout_pct":0,"avg_sec":170.07,"success_pct":0.987},"hypothesis_ts":"2026-06-23T12:17:02.0452507Z","type":"verdict","verdict":"worked","ts":"2026-06-24T23:00:31.1133503Z","commit":"40709082228bfe80109d4b256f7221e57c3a2072"}
