{"baseline":{"timeout_pct":0,"avg_sec":152,"success_pct":0.99},"task":"[Автозадача из бэклога] Extend tools/adversarial-audit.ps1 with the mode/trigger gate that keeps adversarial audit off the nightly cron. Straight implementation + test + commit.\n\n[[NORMAL]]\n\n[operator] Add to tools/adversarial-audit.ps1 (do NOT break existing functions):\n\n1) Test-AuditAdversarialTriggerAllowed -Trigger \u003cstring\u003e:\n   - Allowed triggers (adversarial mode may run): \u0027operator\u0027, \u0027milestone-pretraining\u0027, \u0027milestone-postpipeline\u0027.\n   - Denied triggers: \u0027nightly_cron\u0027, \u0027static_daily\u0027, and ANY unknown/empty value (default-deny).\n   - Return [pscustomobject]@{ allowed=$bool; reason=$string } (reason e.g. \u0027operator-trigger-ok\u0027 or \u0027denied:nightly-cron-cannot-start-adversarial\u0027).\n\n2) Assert-AuditAdversarialAllowed -Trigger \u003cstring\u003e:\n   - Call Test-AuditAdversarialTriggerAllowed; if not allowed, throw \"adversarial audit blocked for trigger \u0027\u003ctrigger\u003e\u0027: \u003creason\u003e\". This is the guard the entrypoint will call before any FIND/VERIFY work.\n\n3) Get-AuditMode -Trigger \u003cstring\u003e:\n   - Map trigger -\u003e mode: allowed adversarial triggers -\u003e \u0027adversarial_milestone\u0027; \u0027nightly_cron\u0027/\u0027static_daily\u0027 -\u003e \u0027static_daily\u0027; unknown -\u003e \u0027static_daily\u0027 (safe default, never adversarial).\n   - Return the mode string.\n\nAdd tools/test-adversarial-trigger.ps1 (new file):\n   - allowed: \u0027operator\u0027 -\u003e allowed=$true; \u0027milestone-pretraining\u0027 -\u003e allowed=$true; \u0027milestone-postpipeline\u0027 -\u003e allowed=$true.\n   - denied: \u0027nightly_cron\u0027 -\u003e allowed=$false; \u0027static_daily\u0027 -\u003e allowed=$false; \u0027random-xyz\u0027 -\u003e allowed=$false; \u0027\u0027 -\u003e allowed=$false.\n   - Assert-AuditAdversarialAllowed -Trigger \u0027nightly_cron\u0027 throws; Assert-AuditAdversarialAllowed -Trigger \u0027operator\u0027 does NOT throw.\n   - Get-AuditMode \u0027operator\u0027 -eq \u0027adversarial_milestone\u0027; Get-AuditMode \u0027nightly_cron\u0027 -eq \u0027static_daily\u0027; Get-AuditMode \u0027whatever\u0027 -eq \u0027static_daily\u0027.\n\nBoth .ps1 must ParseFile clean (PS5.1); the test prints PASS per case + final count, then commit. Reference: project_map_plan.md section 12 (modes/triggers; nightly cron must NOT call adversarial; default-deny) + section 13 Phase 6.\n","commit":"68349fb9c607e958845683441778a4a967fed5cf","type":"hypothesis","ts":"2026-06-25T10:34:20.9771947Z"}
